      "claim": "A parent reports that adults can contact children on Roblox without parental consent.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "adults were still able to contact children on the platform, with the ability to see accounts of children, send connection requests, and the ability to view and respond to each another’s posts on forums outside of games without parents’ consent"
